Two Carnot heat engines (E1 and E2) are operating in series as shown in figure. Engine E1 receives heat from a reservoir at 𝑇_{𝐻} = 1600 K and does work W_{1}. Engine E2 receives heat from an intermediate reservoir at T, does work W_{2} and rejects the rest to a reservoir at 𝑇_{𝐿} = 400 K. Both the engines have identical thermal efficiencies. The temperature T (in K) of the intermediate reservoir is __________ (answer in integer).

W_{1}

W_{2}

